  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/9c167b3e-d012-439f-9d11-c592d6209e36.png\" style=\"width:1.11458in;height:0.8125in\"> <br/>i.e. the largest interval in which <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> decreases is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
